OL,3,GNEWSACalls for whistle-blower debate to
OL,4,Abe held earlier
OL,5,
OL,6,FA minister has been asked to bring
OL,7,Fforward a whistle-blowing law for
OL,8,Fdebate after a unanimous Jersey States
OL,9,FAssembly decision.
OL,11,FA total of 42 politicians voted in
OL,12,Ffavour of the motion to bring forward
OL,13,Fthe debate to no later than 31 January
OL,14,F2027.
OL,16,FCarina Alves, who put forward the
OL,17,Fmotion, said she wanted to make sure a
OL,18,Fprevious decision from 2023 was
OL,19,Fenacted, saying that people should be
OL,20,Fencouraged to raise concerns and
OL,21,Fensuring they had protection when they
OL,22,Fdid so.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
